    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped in a storm. Haunted by the past. Consumed by something far worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your injured partner take shelter in an abandoned mountain cabin as a relentless snowstorm cuts you off from the world. She's gravely wounded \u2014 and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short narrative experience focused on atmosphere, emotion, and psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for tools and supplies to survive the cold, solve surreal puzzles, and uncover fragments of a troubled past. But beware \u2014 something lurks in the shadows, watching. You\u2019ll need to stay quiet, stay alert\u2026 and sometimes, just run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, the cabin transforms. Paintings become portals to nightmarish dreamworlds. Strange figures whisper in empty rooms. Your choices shape the story \u2014 and its ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. No safe places. Just you, the snow, and something that knows you're here.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped in a storm. Haunted by the past. Consumed by something far worse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your injured partner take shelter in an abandoned mountain cabin as a relentless snowstorm cuts you off from the world. She's gravely wounded \u2014 and time is running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short narrative experience focused on atmosphere, emotion, and psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for tools and supplies to survive the cold, solve surreal puzzles, and uncover fragments of a troubled past. But beware \u2014 something lurks in the shadows, watching. You\u2019ll need to stay quiet, stay alert\u2026 and sometimes, just run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, the cabin transforms. Paintings become portals to nightmarish dreamworlds. Strange figures whisper in empty rooms. Your choices shape the story \u2014 and its ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. No safe places. Just you, the snow, and something that knows you're here.</p>",
    "short_description": "A remote mountain cabin, a raging snowstorm, and the line between reality and madness begins to blur. Make difficult choices, explore surreal worlds, and confront what waits in the dark.",
